graph TD
    %% Define Theme Colors
    classDef default fill:#F5F3F0,stroke:#2B2620,stroke-width:2px,color:#2B2620;
    classDef launcher fill:#E5E1DB,stroke:#2B2620,stroke-width:2px,font-weight:bold,color:#2B2620;
    classDef database fill:#E8E4DF,stroke:#2B2620,stroke-width:2px,color:#2B2620;

    subgraph Shopkeeper PC [Shopkeeper Windows Computer]
        BAT[BizionaryERP.bat]:::launcher -->|Launches| EXE[BizionaryERP.exe]:::default
        
        EXE -->|Extracts python runtime & libraries to| INT[_internal / sys._MEIPASS]:::default
        
        EXE -->|1. Starts Local Web Server| Django[Django Backend Server<br/>Port: 8000]:::default
        EXE -->|2. Opens Default Browser| Browser[Shopkeeper Browser<br/>127.0.0.1:8000]:::default
        
        Browser <-->|Sends/Receives REST APIs| Django
        
        Django -->|Serves Static UI Assets| Assets[Packaged React Frontend<br/>HTML/CSS/JS]:::default
        Django <-->|Reads & Writes Local Data| DB[(SQLite Database<br/>File: db.sqlite3)]:::database
    end
